{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object is visible, approach and grab it, then process it and move to destination. Or scan area for objects and process them. list of available nodes: <Action ID = GrabObject    /> <SubTree ID = ProcessObject    /> <Action ID = MoveToDestination    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObjects    /> <SubTree ID = ProcessObjects    /> <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = RandomMovement    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectApproached    />",
